WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.480
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.710
Check it!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:10.610
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.940
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.810
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.480
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.140
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.560
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.260
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.600
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.100
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.400
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.440
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.970
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.780
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.410
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:11.510
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.020
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:18.520
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.930
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.190
Fly up, angel

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:42.610
<i>Clouds sure have it easy...</i>

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:49.350
Since 2002, downtown crime rates
have continued to decrease.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:55.560
This stems from the strengthening
of public safety measures--

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:59.900
<i>What junk are they seriously
talking about now?</i>

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:02.700
<i>Guess clouds aren't the
only ones that have it easy.</i>

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:06.930
--and currently protects
the peace as RAPT.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:21.420
Whoops! My bad!

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:33.700
What?

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:38.190
You're really unique, you know that?

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:42.340
Just watching you makes things fun!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:45.500
Really. You're very
funny and surprising!

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.980
--Am I that funny?
--Yes! Very!

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:56.900
Yeah, I guess I am!
I'm such a goofball!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.500
I'm glad you're such a wonderful person!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:04.170
Yes, I was worried you might
be here for some reason...

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.440
What do you mean?

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:08.140
Like maybe that you were really ill...

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:13.620
Or that you got kicked out of your
last school and got transferred here.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:18.790
But when we saw you, we knew
you weren't that kind of person!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.920
Please don't be offended.

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:25.760
We just live in the same
place in the same way...

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:30.130
We were simply worried you
might disrupt our circle...

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:34.600
No, I'm fine! I'm not offended at all!

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:37.540
See! I have plenty of circle myself!

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.880
Oh, Megumi-<i>san</i>...!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:49.110
--You really are fun!
--That's for sure!

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:54.260
Our next class is in the
upperclassmen building.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:57.750
Be sure to greet them if you pass by them!

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:14.910
--How are you all?
--We are doing wonderfully!

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:18.410
--You're new around here.
--Yes...!

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.180
Angelique-<i>oneesama</i>.

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:24.250
This is Mitarai Megumi-<i>san</i>,
she transferred here last week.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:28.920
I see. Then there is a
lot you still don't know.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.130
I'd like to teach you
all sorts of things.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.860
Come visit our room sometime...!

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:38.520
Now if you'll excuse us.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.600
Their room...?

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:44.240
--Megumi-<i>san</i>!
--How wonderful!

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:48.810
Incredible, Megumi-<i>san</i>!
The Ishtar Club just invited you!

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:52.140
Ishidai Club...?

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:58.550
It's an exclusive club
started by Angelique-<i>oneesama</i>.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:01.020
Members are meant to be
examples to other students,

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:04.330
so she chooses only the
best of mind and body.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:07.630
They even get special
privileges from the principal.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.370
I'm so jealous!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.470
Oh... Well...

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:15.130
I guess some people know
uniqueness when they see it...

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.950
Whew, it's over!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:34.260
I can't believe everyone
could stay that quiet...

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:38.630
Spirits reside in people's words.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:43.470
They say evil spirits are drawn
out by pointless banter and gossip.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:48.670
To us, class is a holy ritual in which
we touch the instructor's spirits.

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:52.000
Holding one's tongue is only natural.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:02.410
<i>This sure is one long prayer...</i>

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.360
<i>Three days of the same thing...</i>

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:23.370
I can't stand everything
being so strict!

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:26.340
Darn it...!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.550
Quiet! It's lights-out time!

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:33.380
Yes! I'm sorry!

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:37.010
Oh! It's time!

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:42.920
This Indian curry is super yummy!

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.100
You think so too, right?

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:49.730
Yeah. Though this soup
is a little spicy.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:54.470
That's not soup, it's curry!
Why are you drinking it first?!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:59.140
Sheesh! You think all
food is the same...!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:02.800
Now, now. I've made one more kind.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.370
Then I humbly accept this!

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.590
Wow! This is yummy too!

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:15.620
I love you, Kyohei-<i>oniichan</i>!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:21.000
But I think we have too big
of an age difference...

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:25.230
--You know?
--Ugh. Guess he can't take a joke.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:33.210
I'm hungry! I wanna go home!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:37.410
Don't tell me you're
all eating good food?!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:41.410
Today was a curry buffet!

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:44.190
Meg! Just give your report!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:50.190
Yeah, alright. This is
definitely one weird place.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.360
How so?

00:07:51.360 --> 00:08:01.870
All the girls here
talk all prissy-like!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.710
You have to bow in the
halls all the time,

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.880
and nobody says a word
during class or meals.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.750
Are you listening?!

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.220
That's normal for a school
full of spoiled girls.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.950
But...!

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:19.760
--Don't forget why you're there!
--I haven't!

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:23.160
I don't wanna wind up like
that girl either, you know!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.390
Help...!

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.110
Stay away...!

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.100
No...!

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:44.580
Stop! Don't!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:48.050
Her hallucination-induced
derangement isn't subsiding.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:50.290
In fact, it's getting worse.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:55.460
We suspect the use of drugs,
but we still don't know the details.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:58.360
All we know is that before the
police took her into their care,

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:02.200
she went to the St. Luciana
Academy boarding school.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:06.760
So her old man was a Bailan leader?

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:11.640
There are drugs that leave
no evidence behind...

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:14.880
It's a rich-girl school,
but don't let your guard down!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:19.310
But I haven't seen
anything so far that--

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:22.450
There were some upperclassmen
who had a weird group!

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.820
The Ishidai... err, the Ishtar Club!

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:31.030
They act all high-and-mighty
and even have their own room.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:32.260
Think you can get in?

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:36.290
Yeah, they told me to come once,
so it should be fine.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.310
Meg? What's going on? Meg?!

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:58.350
No... Stay away...!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.480
Stay away...!

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.400
Stop...! Don't take me away...!

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:10.330
Please... Forgive me!

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:13.800
Hey...!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.410
What're you doing?! You'll fall!

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.900
Forgive me! Please...!

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:24.080
--Forgive me...!
--Hold on, you're--

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:27.640
No... Stay away...!

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.800
Darn it...!

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:53.510
Get up there...!

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:05.820
These girls...
are definitely messed up...

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:34.340
I'm so hungry, Jo...

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:37.940
Huh?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:55.070
Hey! Are you all better now?!

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:57.330
--What does she mean?
--Not sure.

00:11:58.770 --> 00:11:59.910
Hey!

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.310
Wait!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.350
--That hurts!
--Sorry...

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:06.980
But are you okay now?

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.880
What do you mean?

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:13.220
I'm asking if you've calmed down now.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.690
I was worried about you!

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:18.360
Have we met somewhere...?

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:22.300
What, you forgot what
happened on the roof?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.870
I'm not expecting you to
thank me or anything...

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.270
But it's weird for you to just forget!

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:30.710
I don't know what you're
talking about...!

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:34.510
Come on! You tried to
jump off the roof!

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.880
Don't say such things!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:39.650
It'd be a burden if
that became a rumor!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.710
Bye!

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:03.570
"In the crowd, I couldn't move anywhere.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.700
In this town, we don't
listen to the voices--"

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:13.880
Why am I doing this?

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:17.250
I don't think this is the right place.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:20.260
And this get-up is really exhausting...

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.590
Mitarai Megumi-<i>san</i>?

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:25.590
You dropped this...!

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:28.760
Oh, you realized it only now?

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.970
You're lucky none of the
head teachers found out.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:36.100
Actually, it was Angelique-<i>sama</i>
who picked up your name card.

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:39.110
Perhaps you should thank her in person?

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.470
Yeah...

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.140
Come with us.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:49.310
Only a select few are allowed ahead.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:05.200
Megumi-<i>san</i>, was it?

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.440
Yes.

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.970
Welcome to the Ishtar Club...!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:12.010
I'm delighted you came.

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:16.850
I hear you found my name card!
Thank you very much!

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:20.520
We're all friends here.

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:24.090
Don't feel hesitant. Enjoy yourself!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.780
Right...!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.490
--Oh, my!
--Wow!

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:39.900
You certainly have a
unique way of eating!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:44.940
We still have time. Would you
like some hot tea to relax?

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:47.500
This gives off such a wonderful aroma.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:52.810
<i>Ah, so that's how you do it.</i>

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:57.520
It totally does smell great!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.750
Ouch!

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.430
I'm so sorry!

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:07.260
Are you all right...?!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.170
Megumi-<i>san</i>. Don't worry about it.

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:21.180
I'll have this cleaned up;
you return to your classroom.

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:22.470
But...

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:33.360
I really screwed up today. But, oh well!

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:34.990
Megumi-<i>san</i>...

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.290
Who's there...?!

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:40.630
--It's you...
--Sorry about this morning...

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.130
So you didn't forget after all?

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:48.300
No. But my memory of last
night really is fuzzy...

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:54.180
I finally remembered.
It seems I really burdened you...

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.740
That's alright!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:16:00.150
After something like that, it's
only natural to be off in space...

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:03.750
But why did you decide
to commit suicide...?

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.520
Um, well--

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:11.660
You don't have to tell
me if you don't wanna.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:18.500
But you know, people are
born to have lots of fun!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:22.670
Do you assume you can go
to Heaven if you die?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:26.240
Do you know what would happen
if you jumped off the building?

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:28.340
Your head would crack open,
your brains would spill out,

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.210
and you'd wind up like raw garbage!

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:33.420
Do you wanna wind up like that?!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:38.390
Dying won't solve anything!
You'll just wind up a nasty corpse!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.980
If you don't, then staying alive
and working hard is the only choice!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:48.700
I might not be as sophisticated
as the rest of you...

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:53.530
...but I totally learned
that fact from someone.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:03.170
Thanks for earlier.
I'm really glad I got to meet you.

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:08.510
There was never anyone who
talked like that to me.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.480
Megumi-<i>san</i>. Give me your hand.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.380
It's warm...

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:30.200
Yeah! I'll bust outta here
if you don't bring me any!

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.650
Another suicide...?

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.520
Transfer student Mitarai Megumi-<i>san</i>...?

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:43.950
How do you know my name...?

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:49.560
It's a small academy.
Rumors about new people spread quickly.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:52.790
I'm Nadeshiko, head of the
upperclassmen. Nice to meet you!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:55.960
Nice to meet you...!

00:17:55.960 --> 00:18:00.840
Are you aware that going out
during lights-out is forbidden?

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:03.340
Oh, is it?

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:07.980
I was, uh, looking for a bathroom.
My toilet backed up and--

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.950
Why would there be any on the roof?

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:15.550
It's alright. I won't tell anyone.

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:19.650
I'm here to see the night
sky because I can't sleep.

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:21.320
We're both guilty!

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:27.660
So let's keep our rule-breaking
just between us, okay?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:32.770
You don't want to get a chill.
Put this on...

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.830
Thanks, Nadeshiko-<i>san</i>...!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.800
Nadeshiko-<i>san</i>, huh...

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.780
What a nice smell...!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.010
Meg-<i>san</i>. Over here!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.750
Over here!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:55.360
Quiet! We can hear you from
this side of the mountain!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.980
But it's just too funny!

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:02.300
They made me put it on to be safe!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.390
So, did you learn anything?

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:11.110
Looks like the Ishtar Club
members are suspicious.

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:14.700
It's like they have control
over the whole school.

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:20.950
And its leader, Angelique,
has huge scars on her arm!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:23.550
Maybe she's a real risk-taker?

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:27.090
Angelique's dad is an important
person who worked his way up

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:29.160
during the 4th Tokyo Reconstruction Plan.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:35.030
And the Ishtar Club's 'Ishtar'
refers to an ancient goddess of love.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.260
What bad taste!

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:39.830
--Part-timer! Give it to her!
--Right...!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.700
What do you think you're doing?!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.970
I'll have you know I have no
interest in doing that with you!

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:47.280
Here...

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:50.300
They said this works
as a miniature camera!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.710
Not too shabby!

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:59.120
Here's a classroom!

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:01.880
Oh yeah, they can't hear me.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:10.400
--What's she taking pictures of?
--You got me.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:13.570
There, that should be enough.

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:15.870
I forgot the most important place!

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:30.180
Huh? There's nobody here...

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:34.750
I'll get this too...

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:41.860
--Hey! Stop goofing around!
--She can't hear you from here.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.560
I know that!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:47.370
Wonder if there are any other sweets...

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:50.100
Maybe there's some hidden behind here...

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:54.070
What is this?

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:04.240
Meg?!

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:16.090
I never heard about this!

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:31.940
No way...

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:05.410
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:13.050
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:20.760
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:30.140
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:36.680
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:45.750
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:53.320
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:15.880
<i>Real, or an illusion?</i>

00:23:15.880 --> 00:23:18.950
<i>Jo's bullets explode as
she takes on a monster</i>

00:23:18.950 --> 00:23:21.550
<i>from a strange dream world.</i>

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:26.580
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Wash this Flower Garden with Blood!"
